{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Act as an expert Shopify theme developer. Generate a responsive, pixel-perfect, custom sections block for a Case Study Spotlight component. The design must precisely mirror the layout, spacing, and styling details provided below while automatically inheriting the current Shopify theme's global typography, primary max-width (e.g., 1200px), and core button styles to ensure seamless theme integration.
    
    ---
    
    ### 1. SECTION ARCHITECTURE & LAYOUT
    
    Create a parent container that wraps individual "Case Study" blocks. Each block consists of three primary vertical zones stacked with intentional, clean whitespace:
    
    #### ZONE 1: HEADER (Flex Row, Space-Between)
    - Left Side: A small, subtle neutral icon inside a rounded-square badge (border-radius: 12px, light grey border). Next to it, stack the title text:
      - Meta-info: "Fashion • Enterprise Scale" (Small, muted grey text)
      - Case Study Title: "Major Japanese Fashion Retailer" (Bold, prominent, dark navy/slate color)
      - Sub-info: "124 → 220 stores" (Muted text showing scale change)
    - Right Side: A solid pill-shaped badge labeled "FEATURED" using a muted olive/moss green background (`#a4b953` or similar theme variant) with white uppercase text.
    
    #### ZONE 2: INTRODUCTORY PARAGRAPH
    - A full-width, 2-3 sentence summary paragraph. 
    - Styling: Medium-grey text color, comfortable line-height (e.g., 1.6), and generous top/bottom margin to separate it from the header and the results card.
    
    #### ZONE 3: MEASURED RESULTS CARD (Grid Container)
    - A full-width callout box with a very soft, light cream/green tinted background, rounded corners (border-radius: 16px), and internal padding (around 24px-32px).
    - Inside, lay out a 2x2 grid (collapsing to a 1x4 stack on mobile devices):
      - Each grid item contains a small, solid moss-green square icon (`#a4b953`) with a white upward-trending arrow.
      - Text inline or stacked next to the icon: Bold the metric or main phrase, followed by regular weight for details (e.g., "**Conversion improved 8.93%**", "**Sales increased 8.25%** = ¥1.8 billion additional revenue", "**ROI exceeded 50x** (¥24,000/store/month cost)", "**Expanded to 220+ stores**").
    
    #### ZONE 4: TWO-COLUMN DETAILS (Flex/Grid, 50/50 Split)
    - Below the results card, split the layout into two columns on desktop (stacked on mobile):
      - Column 1 (CHALLENGES BEFORE): A bulleted list with a subtle grey disc. Text color is a muted slate grey.
      - Column 2 (OPERATIONAL IMPACT): A list utilizing thin green checkmarks instead of bullet points. Text color is a darker slate grey.
    - Ensure clear headings for both columns in muted, uppercase typography.
    
    #### ZONE 5: FOOTER & BUTTON
    - A full-width dark navy button (`#0a2240` or the theme's primary dark color) aligned to the bottom left. 
    - Features white text, an right-facing arrow icon (→), and explicit padding to match the theme’s standard button styling.
    - A thin, full-width neutral divider line separates this section block from the next block.
    
    ---
    
    ### 2. DESIGN & BRAND ALIGNMENT RULES
    
    - Typography: Do NOT hardcode font families. Inherit the Shopify theme's heading font for titles/metrics and the theme's body font for lists and descriptions.
    - Sizing & Max-Width: Constrain the component within the theme's standard section wrapper max-width. Ensure it centers automatically on large viewports.
    - Spacing: Use a systematic spacing hierarchy (e.g., 40px padding between major zones, 12px between sub-elements) to maintain an editorial, clean layout.
    - Repeatable Logic: Ensure this logic is structured as a repeatable Shopify theme block so multiple distinct case studies can be stacked or rendered sequentially.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-case-study-spotlight-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: {{ settings.page_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--spacing-section-horizontal);
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 40px;
    padding-bottom: 40px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba({{ block.settings.divider_color.red }}, {{ block.settings.divider_color.green }}, {{ block.settings.divider_color.blue }}, 0.2);
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__header-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 280px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__icon-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.icon_badge_border_color }};
    background-color: {{ block.settings.icon_badge_background }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: {{ block.settings.icon_badge_color }};
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__icon-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__title-group-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__meta-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.meta_text_color }};
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__sub-info-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: {{ block.settings.meta_text_color }};
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__featured-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.featured_badge_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.featured_badge_text_color }};
    border-radius: 24px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__intro-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.intro_text_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__results-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.results_card_background }};
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 32px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__results-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__result-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__result-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.result_icon_background }};
    border-radius: 6px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: {{ block.settings.result_icon_color }};
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__result-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 18px;
    height: 18px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__result-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 1;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: {{ block.settings.result_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__result-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} strong {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__details-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 32px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__detail-column-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__detail-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    color: {{ block.settings.meta_text_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__detail-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__detail-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: {{ block.settings.detail_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__detail-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} li::before {
    content: '';
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.bullet_color }};
    margin-top: 7px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__detail-list-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-case-study-spotlight__detail-list--checkmark-{{ ai_gen_id }} li::before {
    content: '✓';
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
    background-color: transparent;
    color: {{ block.settings.checkmark_color }};
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 14px 28px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: {{ settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 16px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_background }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-case-study-spotlight__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-case-study-spotlight__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .ai-case-study-spotlight__header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .ai-case-study-spotlight__header-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      min-width: 100%;
    }

    .ai-case-study-spotlight__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .ai-case-study-spotlight__results-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .ai-case-study-spotlight__results-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .ai-case-study-spotlight__details-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<case-study-spotlight-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-case-study-spotlight-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    
    <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__header-left-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__icon-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M20 7h-9"></path>
            <path d="M14 17H5"></path>
            <circle cx="17" cy="17" r="3"></circle>
            <circle cx="7" cy="7" r="3"></circle>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__title-group-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {%- if block.settings.meta_info != blank -%}
            <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__meta-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.meta_info }}</div>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if block.settings.case_study_title != blank -%}
            <h3 class="ai-case-study-spotlight__title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.case_study_title }}</h3>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if block.settings.sub_info != blank -%}
            <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__sub-info-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.sub_info }}</div>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      </div>
      {%- if block.settings.show_featured_badge -%}
        <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__featured-badge-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.featured_badge_text }}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- if block.settings.intro_paragraph != blank -%}
      <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__intro-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {{ block.settings.intro_paragraph }}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__results-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__results-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {%- if block.settings.result_1 != blank -%}
          <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__result-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__result-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="18 15 12 9 6 15"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__result-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.result_1 }}</div>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if block.settings.result_2 != blank -%}
          <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__result-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__result-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="18 15 12 9 6 15"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__result-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.result_2 }}</div>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if block.settings.result_3 != blank -%}
          <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__result-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__result-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="18 15 12 9 6 15"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__result-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.result_3 }}</div>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
        {%- if block.settings.result_4 != blank -%}
          <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__result-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__result-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="18 15 12 9 6 15"></polyline>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__result-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.result_4 }}</div>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__details-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__detail-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {%- if block.settings.challenges_heading != blank -%}
          <h4 class="ai-case-study-spotlight__detail-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.challenges_heading }}</h4>
        {%- endif -%}
        <ul class="ai-case-study-spotlight__detail-list-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {%- if block.settings.challenge_1 != blank -%}
            <li>{{ block.settings.challenge_1 }}</li>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if block.settings.challenge_2 != blank -%}
            <li>{{ block.settings.challenge_2 }}</li>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if block.settings.challenge_3 != blank -%}
            <li>{{ block.settings.challenge_3 }}</li>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if block.settings.challenge_4 != blank -%}
            <li>{{ block.settings.challenge_4 }}</li>
          {%- endif -%}
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__detail-column-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {%- if block.settings.impact_heading != blank -%}
          <h4 class="ai-case-study-spotlight__detail-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.impact_heading }}</h4>
        {%- endif -%}
        <ul class="ai-case-study-spotlight__detail-list-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-case-study-spotlight__detail-list--checkmark-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {%- if block.settings.impact_1 != blank -%}
            <li>{{ block.settings.impact_1 }}</li>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if block.settings.impact_2 != blank -%}
            <li>{{ block.settings.impact_2 }}</li>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if block.settings.impact_3 != blank -%}
            <li>{{ block.settings.impact_3 }}</li>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if block.settings.impact_4 != blank -%}
            <li>{{ block.settings.impact_4 }}</li>
          {%- endif -%}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- if block.settings.button_text != blank -%}
      <div class="ai-case-study-spotlight__footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <a href="{{ block.settings.button_link }}" class="ai-case-study-spotlight__button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ block.settings.button_text }}
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
            <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
          </svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

  </div>
</case-study-spotlight-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class CaseStudySpotlight{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.style.display = 'block';
      }
    }

    customElements.define('case-study-spotlight-{{ ai_gen_id }}', CaseStudySpotlight{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

